{
  "name": "Medusa → Analytics & Event Log",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "medusa-events",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": true
        }
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 300],
      "webhookId": "medusa-analytics"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "event-name",
              "name": "event",
              "value": "={{ $json.event }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "data-json",
              "name": "data",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.data) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "timestamp",
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{ $json.timestamp }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "source",
              "name": "source",
              "value": "={{ $json.source }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-log",
      "name": "Format Log Entry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [440, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Analytics & Event Log Workflow\n\nCaptures ALL Medusa events for logging, monitoring, and analytics.\n\n### Setup Steps:\n1. **Activate this workflow**\n2. **Add a destination node** after 'Format Log Entry':\n   - **Google Sheets** — append each event as a row\n   - **Postgres/MySQL** — insert into an events table\n   - **Slack** — send critical events to a channel\n   - **HTTP Request** — forward to analytics service\n\n### Payload Structure:\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"order.placed\",\n  \"data\": { \"id\": \"order_xxx\", ... },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-08T14:48:35.000Z\",\n  \"source\": \"medusa\"\n}\n```\n\n### Tip:\nFor Google Sheets, create columns: event | data | timestamp | source",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, -80]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Log Entry",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "medusa"
    }
  ]
}
